+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/madeWithinContextOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
+msgid "S1 made within context of S2: S1 is a standpoint that exists for reading works, and the readings it holds were made within the context of the frame S2. It is not a sharpening: S1 does not become a case of S2, the relation by itself says nothing about which precisifications either frame admits, and two standpoints that share one context are not thereby refinements of each other. It is not a subproperty of gmeow:sharpens and entails nothing about it, so no gmeow:sharpens edge follows from it and none is removed by it. No property characteristic is declared: it is not transitive, because a frame that supplied the context for one set of readings does not thereby supply it for the readings made within that frame's own context, and chaining would build the refinement-like order this relation exists to avoid; it is not symmetric, because the object is the frame and the subject is the reader; and irreflexivity is withheld because a standpoint that reads works within its own context is a legitimate degenerate case that a gate must not reject. It is for a standpoint that exists for reading works, not for a person or party who also holds claims about other things; such a holder is related to the claims it holds with gmeow:accordingTo."
+msgstr "S1 在 S2 的语境内作出：S1 是一个为阅读作品而存在的立场，其所持的解读是在框架 S2 的语境之内作出的。它不是锐化：S1 不会成为 S2 的一个特例，该关系本身并不说明任一框架容许哪些精确化，共享同一语境的两个立场也不因此互为精化。它不是 gmeow:sharpens 的子属性，也不蕴含任何关于它的内容，因此不会由它推出 gmeow:sharpens 边，也不会由它移除任何此类边。它不声明任何属性特征：它不是传递的，因为为一组解读提供语境的框架，并不因此为在该框架自身语境内作出的解读提供语境，而串联会构造出本关系旨在避免的类精化顺序；它不是对称的，因为宾语是框架，主语是阅读者；也不声明非自反性，因为在自身语境内阅读作品的立场是合理的退化情形，门不得拒绝。它适用于为阅读作品而存在的立场，不适用于同时还持有关于其他事物之主张的个人或一方；此类持有者通过 gmeow:accordingTo 与其所持主张相关联。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/madeWithinContextOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
+msgid "ex:formalistReading gmeow:madeWithinContextOf ex:interwarCriticism ."
+msgstr "ex:formalistReading gmeow:madeWithinContextOf ex:interwarCriticism ."
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/madeWithinContextOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
+msgid "Avoid it to say one frame is a more specific case of another, which is gmeow:sharpens; avoid it for a person or party who holds claims about things other than the reading of works; avoid reading two standpoints with the same object as ordered, equal or one sharper than the other; and avoid chaining it into a context of a context."
+msgstr "避免用它表示某个框架是另一个框架的更具体特例，那是 gmeow:sharpens 的用途；避免用于持有关于阅读作品之外其他事物主张的个人或一方；避免把宾语相同的两个立场读作有序、相等或其一更锐化；避免将其串联成语境的语境。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/madeWithinContextOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
+msgid "Assert it from the standpoint that exists for reading works to the frame whose context its readings were made within. Use gmeow:Standpoint for both ends; no class is specific to a standpoint that reads works, and gmeow:ReadingOrder is a different notion, a standpoint that orders the segments of a work for consumption, so do not use it as the subject unless that ordering standpoint is itself the one whose readings were made within the context. Add a gmeow:sharpens edge separately and only when one frame really is a refinement of the other."
+msgstr "从为阅读作品而存在的立场指向其解读所处语境的框架来断言它。两端都使用 gmeow:Standpoint；不存在专属于阅读作品之立场的类，而 gmeow:ReadingOrder 是另一种概念，即为消费而排列作品各片段的立场，因此不要将其用作主语，除非该排序立场本身正是其解读在该语境内作出的那一个。仅当一个框架确为另一个框架的精化时，才另行添加 gmeow:sharpens 边。"
+
+msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/madeWithinContextOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
+msgid "Use to record that a standpoint set up to read works made its readings within the context of another frame, when the two share a context but neither is a sharper case of the other."
+msgstr "当为阅读作品而设立的立场在另一框架的语境内作出其解读，且两者共享语境而彼此都不是更锐化的特例时使用。"
+
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
 msgid "more entrenched than"
 msgstr "比……更根深蒂固"
